sec.p:
In relation to the Terms of Reference, the CONTAM Panel concluded:
on the basis of the information submitted by the feed business operators the proposed decontamination process is effective in reducing HCN from linseed;
the process does not lead to any detrimental changes in the nature of linseed;
the proposed decontamination process to remove HCN from linseed, was assessed to be compliant with the acceptability criteria provided in Commission Regulation (EU) 2015/786 of 19 May 2015.
